  "description": "A lightweight Blazor Server circuit reconnection handler. Shows professional reconnect UI when the circuit is lost. Correctly observes Blazor's reconnect-show / reconnect-hide / reconnect-failed class lifecycle — modal auto-hides on recovery and only force-reloads on permanent circuit expiry. Non-invasive — works with Blazor's default startup.",
